  <title>Perintah Saya Di Mana</title>
  <p>
    <app>Orca</app>'s Where Am I feature gives you context-sensitive details
    about your present location. For instance, in tables, Where Am I will give
    you details about the table cell you are in, but in text it will present
    the current line along with any text which happens to be selected. The full
    list of what you can expect <app>Orca</app> to present can be found in the
    <link xref="howto_whereami">Introduction to Where Am I</link>.
  </p>
  <p><app>Orca</app> provides the following Where Am I commands:</p>
  <list>
    <item>
      <p>Lakukan Di Mana Saya dasar:</p>
      <list>
        <item>
          <p>Desktop: <key>KP Enter</key></p>
        </item>
        <item>
          <p>Laptop: <keyseq><key>Pengubah Orca</key><key>Return</key></keyseq></p>
        </item>
      </list>
    </item>
    <item>
      <p>Lakukan Di Mana Saya terrinci:</p>
      <list>
        <item>
          <p>Desktop: <key>KP Enter</key> (klik ganda)</p>
        </item>
        <item>
          <p>Laptop: <keyseq><key>Pengubah Orca</key><key>Return</key></keyseq> (klik-ganda)</p>
        </item>
      </list>
    </item>
  </list>
  <p>
    In addition to the dedicated Where Am I commands, <app>Orca</app> has
    additional commands related to obtaining information about your present location:
  </p>
  <list>
    <item>
      <p>Sajikan bilah judul:</p>
      <list>
        <item>
          <p>Desktop: <keyseq><key>Pengubah Orca</key><key>KP Enter</key></keyseq></p>
        </item>
        <item>
          <p>Laptop: <keyseq><key>Pengubah Orca</key><key>Garis Miring</key></keyseq></p>
        </item>
      </list>
    </item>
    <item>
      <p>Sajikan bilah status:</p>
      <list>
        <item>
          <p>Desktop: <keyseq><key>Pengubah Orca</key><key>KP Enter</key></keyseq> (klik dua kali)</p>
        </item>
        <item>
          <p>Laptop: <keyseq><key>Pengubah Orca</key><key>Garis Miring</key></keyseq> (klik dua kali)</p>
        </item>
        <item>
          <p>Present size and location of current object in pixels: (Unbound)</p>
        </item>
      </list>
    </item>
  </list>
